  <name>                the milestone's name

Flags:
  --target YYYY-MM-DD         the target date; must be a date in YYYY-MM-DD form (checked before
                              anything is sent). Default: no target date.
  --sort <n>                  its position within the project, ascending. Default: the server's
                              default order.

Who may run it:
  a person: admin or above in the workspace
  an agent token: the plan scope

Calls:
  POST /v1/projects/:projectId/milestones

Examples:
  supi milestone add prj_5b10… 'Beta' --target 2026-11-15 --sort 1
",
}
`;

